   "core/parsers/matrix_1axis.py - color x size grid, one row per size (SAKHA).\n\nSAKHA (PO10151998) is COLIN'S-format but splits the order per DESTINATION:\n    DESTINATION DETAILS\n    Destination Code:EG.CL.R ... Delivery Date:15.10.2026\n    COLOR NO COLOR XS S M L XL XXL XXS XXXL TOTAL   <- size header (positions)\n    DN45492 SAKHA WASH 5 4 3 10 22                  <- color row (zeros dropped)\nEach destination becomes an OrderEntity (same po_no, distinct destination_code).\nOnly destination blocks under ``section_anchor`` (\"DESTINATION DETAILS\") are read,\nso PACKAGING DETAILS / COLOR DETAILS summaries are not double-counted.\nLines are merged per (color, size) so assorted/non-assorted sub-blocks of one\ndestination sum into the true ordered quantity (keeps the _Row Key unique).\n",
